<h1>Release notes</h1>
<p>This release adds <strong>state machines</strong> and fixes <em>many</em> bugs.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>faster <code>lexer</code></li>
  <li>new &lt;parser&gt; API</li>
  <li>fewer allocations</li>
</ul>
<ol>
  <li>read the docs</li>
  <li>upgrade</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>Simple things should be simple, complex things possible.</blockquote>
<pre><code class="ruby">
if a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c
  puts "x"
</code></pre>
<p>Trailing paragraph with a_b and 3 * 4.</p>
<pre><code>
unterminated block
</code></pre>
